    "description": "Smart Compass\r\nFree smart compass for android make your trip easier. Most precise and simple digital compass free find your direction.\r\nSmart compass app & magnetic compass free has a simple and comfortable user interface. Directions compass give advanced compass smart view that is completely accurate compass and can operate anywhere without restrictions on location.\r\n\r\nThe smart compass 360\u00b0 has a selection of different compass digital direction designs with South East, North, West. Best digital compass for android has a number of features that provide useful information like current location and accurate weather updates.\r\nThere is no need for any type of brujula when you have a real free compass app. Free download digital compass online that is easy to use compass direction finder.\r\n\r\nHighlights of \u201cSmart Compass - Digital Compass\u201d:\r\nSmart compass app simple & easy to use\r\nQibla Compass\r\nStandard compass\r\nMagnetic strength\r\nReal time weather update\r\nTelescope compass view\r\nMagnetic compass for android\r\nLive compass navigation can be used for the current location\r\nShow latitude longitude compass view\r\nSouth east & true north compass app\r\nWeather compass for weather details by auto-selected city\r\nDirection finder app with camera compass smart view\r\nMultiple style of compass meter with Qibla connect\r\nMultiple languages compass rose interface\r\nCompass app android easy to share\r\nMultiple types broken compass\r\n\r\nDirection Compass\r\nYou can use the free direction compass anywhere and anytime in the world such as when you traveling, hiking, want to save your location, car parking, hotel and Qibla direction. A visual compass app is an excellent GPS navigation compass that displays four main directions (north, south, east & west). Digital compass app for android gives you exact location using a GPS location navigation. The graphical interface of this free compass app is so cool and attractive. Virtual compass free for correct direction show latitude & longitude location compass that gives you a better root to reach your destination. My compass free app required a magnetic sensor in your cell phone.\r\n\r\nDigital Compass\r\nDigital Compass: Smart Compass app is useful app especially, when you go to tours and other mountain places & face any difficulty to install this compass free app. Standard Compass \u2013 Smart Compass for android devices is a good tool for any outdoor activity. Virtual compass for correct direction provide this best digital compass app for android that is easy to use for all those people who spend their time in outdoor activities. Rotate yourself with smart compass navigation and get exact digital compass 360 direction on the map.\r\n\r\nQibla Compass\r\nQibla finder compass help Muslims to find the accurate Qibla direction from all around the world. Qibla is also know as Kaaba that it is situated in Mecca Saudi Arabia. Muslims can easily find Kaaba direction very easily and faster with qibla compass app.\r\n\r\nEasily find Mecca direction, Nearest Mosque from your location. Try Mecca finder app for android.",
